    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Battle of Orks</i> is a shared-screen co-op game that blends orks with slot machine mechanics! Summon your orks, enter the fray, and lead your team to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Orks with Unique Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Battle of Orks</i>, you\u2019ll build your team from a unique cast of orks before each battle. Each ork belongs to a clan, and picking a clan \u201cleader\u201d will grant powerful bonuses to help shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/7c2900dac5b9af9f929182f6bba6d752.poster.avif?t=1748407469\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/7c2900dac5b9af9f929182f6bba6d752.webm?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/7c2900dac5b9af9f929182f6bba6d752.mp4?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Competition of Strategy and Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: pull the lever to summon orks! But winning takes a clever strategy\u2014place double bets at key moments to score more coins and maximize your rewards. Landing three  three matching symbols might even summon a special ork, whose skills and buffs can shift the battle in your favor. Stay sharp and use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/a4c38dd3bffc00a0d3ae49e669dcb464.poster.avif?t=1748407469\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/a4c38dd3bffc00a0d3ae49e669dcb464.webm?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/a4c38dd3bffc00a0d3ae49e669dcb464.mp4?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just Click!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Unlimited Time mode kicks in, forget all the rules and just click! ! ! The faster you click, the more orks charge into battle, overwhelming your opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/25202e4bdc800d6191916854c052170a.poster.avif?t=1748407469\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/25202e4bdc800d6191916854c052170a.webm?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/25202e4bdc800d6191916854c052170a.mp4?t=1748407469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
